### List articles (default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/articles?limit=20&offset=0
Accept: application/json

### List articles with filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/articles?key=%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B&category=backend&tag=go&limit=10&offset=0
Accept: application/json

### List articles next page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/articles?limit=5&offset=5
Accept: application/json

### Get article by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/articles/1
Accept: application/json

### Get article by id that does not exist (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/articles/999999
Accept: application/json

### Create article
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/articles
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "slug": "hello-world",
  "status": "PUBLISHED",
  "title": "你好，世界",
  "summary": "示例文章",
  "markdown_content": "# 你好\n\n这是一篇示例文章。",
  "html_content": "<h1>你好</h1><p>这是一篇示例文章。</p>"
}

### Public article page (MVC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/articles/hello-world
Accept: text/html
